<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#0F172A', padding: '20px 64px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 80, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 38, background: 'linear-gradient(180deg, #3B82F6, #06B6D4)', borderRadius: 3 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0' }}>模块二 · 与核心引擎联动（王天豪）</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#06B6D4', marginLeft: 12, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>判与演，口径一致</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32, alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '47%', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 13 }}>
      <Box style={{ padding: '12px 16px', background: 'rgba(6,182,212,0.10)', borderRadius: 10, borderLeft: '4px solid #06B6D4' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>定位：本模块是<span style={{ color: '#06B6D4', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>核心引擎的下游消费者</span>，不是孤立功能。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>• 直接消费模块一 <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Consolas, monospace', color:'#93C5FD' }}>AgentService.infer()</Text> 的 level / score / evidence。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>• 推演与评分都沿用同一套风险定级，保证「判」与「演」不打架。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>• 结果经模块三档案回写，形成跨模块数据闭环。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>契约清晰：上游改判定口径，下游自动跟随，无需重写。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '53%', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <svg width='540' height='320' viewBox='0 0 540 320'>
        <defs>
          <marker id='ar15' markerWidth='9' markerHeight='9' refX='7' refY='3' orient='auto'>
            <path d='M0,0 L7,3 L0,6 Z' fill='#64748B' />
          </marker>
        </defs>
        <rect x='180' y='14' width='180' height='52' rx='10' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#8B5CF6' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='270' y='38' textAnchor='middle' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold'>infer() 判定</text>
        <text x='270' y='56' textAnchor='middle' fill='#C4B5FD' fontSize='12'>模块一 · 规则引擎</text>
        <rect x='30' y='120' width='190' height='52' rx='10' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#06B6D4' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='125' y='144' textAnchor='middle' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold'>simulate_step</text>
        <text x='125' y='162' textAnchor='middle' fill='#67E8F9' fontSize='12'>仿真后果链</text>
        <rect x='320' y='120' width='190' height='52' rx='10' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#06B6D4' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='415' y='144' textAnchor='middle' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold'>compute_risk_score</text>
        <text x='415' y='162' textAnchor='middle' fill='#67E8F9' fontSize='12'>透明评分</text>
        <rect x='175' y='240' width='190' height='52' rx='10' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#06B6D4' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='270' y='264' textAnchor='middle' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold'>档案回写</text>
        <text x='270' y='282' textAnchor='middle' fill='#67E8F9' fontSize='12'>模块三 · 闭环</text>
        <line x1='245' y1='66' x2='125' y2='120' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar15)' />
        <line x1='295' y1='66' x2='415' y2='120' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar15)' />
        <line x1='125' y1='172' x2='230' y2='240' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar15)' />
        <line x1='415' y1='172' x2='310' y2='240' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar15)' />
      </svg>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 56, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, padding: '0 18px', background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(6,182,212,0.16), rgba(59,130,246,0.05))', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid rgba(6,182,212,0.35)' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#06B6D4', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>答辩亮点</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17.5, color: '#E2E8F0' }}>上下游契约清晰：模块解耦却不脱节，核心引擎一改口径，仿真与评分自动跟随。</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>实战避错系统 · 团队分工</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>15 / 25</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
